cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the paper."
title: "MOME: Metamorphic Evidence as a Runtime Reliability Signal for Small Language Models"
abstract: >-
  A black-box, label-free runtime gate for quantized small language models.
  Each problem is perturbed in two directions by rule -- a restatement whose
  answer must hold and an edit whose answer must change -- and the responses
  form a metamorphic fingerprint that a fixed predictor turns into a
  serve/verify/decline decision. No hidden state is read and no correct answer
  is used at inference.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22854894
repository-code: "https://github.com/mrbong77-sys/MOME_Public"
authors:
